// `StaticSpec.PreventionBan` under Lean's own name for it: the alias
// `declare_semantic_primitives` generates, so a card writes a macro where the
// basis has a constructor (ADR 12.1).
(
    name: "preventionBan",
    kinds: [StaticSpec],
    params: {"kind": DamageKind, "damage": Any, "ban": Any},
    body: PreventionBan(kind: Param(kind), damage: Param(damage), ban: Param(ban)),
)
